nly .git/objects/pack/*.pack. The rewritten baseline tree itself was already 290,690,203 logical bytes. A current fresh single-branch clone is 1,186,317,529 logical bytes / 1,475,424,256 allocated bytes while its pack is only 322.57 MiB. The pack-only metric therefore cannot detect checkout payload or small-file allocation growth. Discovered during absurd-zoometric-bobwhite.\n\n## Plan\n- Define separate authoritative metrics for reachable pack bytes, checked-out logical bytes, checked-out allocated bytes, file count/block slack, and total fresh-clone footprint.\n- Measure them from a fresh unfiltered single-branch tickets clone with platform-tolerant reporting.\n- Add enforceable budgets and trend evidence at an operation-linked or in-process seam, with CI as an optional trigger rather than the only trigger.\n- Correct operator documentation so pack size is never described as whole-clone size.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each size layer has an unambiguous definition and reproducible measurement.\n- [ ] A regression fixture where pack bytes pass but checkout or allocated bytes fail is detected.\n- [ ] Budget enforcement is portable to projects without this repository CI provider.\n- [ ] Reclaim and capacity documentation distinguish pack, tree, and whole-clone claims.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["store","git","capacity","regression"],"ticket_id":"0754-cfc5-e451-4e9b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Enforce whole tickets-store footprint budgets beyond Git pack bytes","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1e5cb049-de46-418e-a160-6afe10a009e6","c483be9e-addf-4a42-8d3d-1f60cb9085c8"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787520768302609002,"uuid":"6b818192-3a10-4569-9a9f-b6e842f5f6cd"}